#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:5 2a413d4bcdbf4a879e0e1e8129ba4411
msgid "_`Usage`"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:7 ed732cfdba65400895b2b7f611429e0f
msgid "The conanfile.py is the Conan package configuration file for this project, responsible for dependency management, package metadata processing, and module generation."
msgstr "conanfile.py 是本项目的 Conan 包配置文件，负责依赖管理、包元数据处理与模块生成。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:11 a8d9bd7190104bdcb2697eab12b7c2cd
msgid "_`Main Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:13 a468586ca16e40fb860097520cc96274
msgid "Project metadata initialization"
msgstr "项目元数据初始化"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:14 458fcbc788d7406ab11ee3bb22ec61d2
msgid "Dependency management"
msgstr "依赖管理"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:15 b1a2ced0fd0f4bf5bad0261b40f8e7f9
msgid "Module file generation and processing"
msgstr "模块文件生成与处理"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:16 c58344c6c33b46868cf5ec059b416e46
msgid "Build configuration generation"
msgstr "构建配置生成"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:17 97e610e53daa4d6481558d510e7a6af5
msgid "Package information definition"
msgstr "包信息定义"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:20 ff9d3f896bf045e2873b6c0d15a3baf5
msgid "_`Core Functionality`"
msgstr "核心功能"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:22 144a4ff282c84847989a97ce8345b6fd
msgid ""
"The PackageRecipe class handles project initialization by loading "
"information from metadata.json. It processes module files by generating "
"them from .hpp and .cpp files, handling export and attach markers. "
"Dependency management is implemented by loading requirements from "
"conandata.yml."
msgstr ""
"PackageRecipe 类通过从 metadata.json 加载信息来处理项目初始化。它通过从.hpp 和 .cpp "
"文件生成模块文件来处理它们，并处理导出（export）和附加（attach）标记。依赖管理是通过从 conandata.yml 加载需求来实现的。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:26 039c6fe301ca4390a72742f76a66c50e
msgid ""
"The configuration generates CMake toolchain and dependencies files, and "
"defines package components with their dependencies. Special features "
"include C header compatibility processing and comment marker handling for"
" export/attach operations."
msgstr "该配置会生成 CMake 工具链和依赖文件，并定义带有依赖关系的包组件。特殊功能包括C 头文件兼容性处理以及用于导出/附加操作的注释标记处理。"
